         "widgetType": "text-editor",
         "settings": {
          "editor": "The design system records the founder paragraph as still to be written. Add it here in the first person: why this was started, what was wrong with the directories that already existed, and what Gototherapy will not do. No claims about numbers of members or people helped unless something counts them.",
